{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriscoveries/cifast/issues/140","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriscoveries/cifast","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriscoveries/cifast/issues/140/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriscoveries/cifast/issues/140/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriscoveries/cifast/issues/140/events","html_url":"https://github.com/chriscoveries/cifast/issues/140","id":5936215814,"node_id":"I_kwDOVJoKq88AAAABYdN3Bg","number":140,"title":"Automatic Actions filtering: enforce artifact/retention/run/routing policy across repos, alert before quota","user":{"login":"chriscoveries","id":212684707,"node_id":"U_kgDODK1Pow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212684707?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chriscoveries","html_url":"https://github.com/chriscoveries","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chriscoveries/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chriscoveries/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chriscoveries/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chriscoveries/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chriscoveries/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chriscoveries/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chriscoveries/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chriscoveries/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chriscoveries/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-20T05:01:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T05:01:05Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Problem\nNothing filters GitHub Actions usage automatically, so waste is only found after it hurts.\n\nTrigger (2026-10-20): WICK artifact uploads hit the account's Actions storage quota. The cause was another repo. obsrust-fork held 8 OBS build artifacts from 2026-10-15 (commit b74a49ddb, 1.7 GB: Windows/macOS/Ubuntu/flatpak builds, debug symbols, sources). They were uploaded under a 90-day retention, so they would have stayed until 2027-01-13 even after the repo's retention was cut to 1 day. That repo used about 58 of the account's ~58 GB-hours on 19 Oct. The seat deleted them by hand once the owner approved.\n\n## Feature: automatic Actions filtering\ncifast applies policy to every chriscoveries repo's Actions runs and outputs, deterministically, with no human in the loop:\n1. **Artifact filter:** flag or delete artifacts over a size cap, and any whose `expires_at` exceeds the repo's current retention. Retention cuts must apply to artifacts uploaded before the cut.\n2. **Retention policy:** enforce `artifact-and-log-retention` per repo from one config. Report any drift.\n3. **Run filter:** skip or cancel runs that policy says shouldn't run, for example superseded commits on the same ref, or paths that don't affect the build. Never cancel a run by age alone.\n4. **Routing filter:** public repos run on GitHub-hosted runners only, private repos on cifast. Flag any workflow that breaks this.\n5. **Budget view:** read per-repo Actions storage and minutes from `users/chriscoveries/settings/billing/usage` (chriscoveries is a user account, not an org). Alert the seat before a quota is hit, not after.\n\n## Constraints\n- No GitHub polling loops. Use a scheduled job with a bounded call budget through ghgate/ghx.\n- Every action is logged with bytes and minutes saved.\n- Deletes only touch artifacts reproducible from a commit, and are listed before the first enforcing run.\n- Fixtures and tests use real captured API responses only (no synthetic data).\n\n## Done when\n- The 2026-10-20 case (old artifacts outliving a retention cut) is caught automatically on a real repo.\n- A per-repo storage report runs on schedule and alerts at a threshold.\n- The policy lives in one config file in this repo, deployed with the canonical cifast deploy.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriscoveries/cifast/issues/140/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriscoveries/cifast/issues/140/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}